'''Mayor Nancy''' is a [[Mayor]] that appears if no mayor has been elected [[Mayor]]. She has no perks. She can appear for unknown reasons in certain lobbies that haven't updated or on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]] if there is no elected [[Mayor]].

She also appears as the Minister if a Special Mayor is elected. 

